    "title": "Corrected: Planned Outage for Hay Springs Next Wednesday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jett Rasmussen ,\n1 days ago On Monday Nebraska Public Power District (NPPD) released via Facebook that a planned power outage is scheduled for next Wednesday, December 10 in the Hay Springs area. The notice is intended to inform NPPD customers in Hay Springs that power will not be available between 10 p.m. and Midnight (12 a.m.) MST Wednesday evening. The outage itself is being conducted so crews can perform needed maintenance at the substation. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
